      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然要奔跑……既然要活下去！\n当然想成为被后世传颂的赛马娘啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bb24d49203c465749ffd5826645c0aacc48859ce5f2b7b5ac8974dc42806165",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
