    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:991c106f26b192d2b9a3c6db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "争夺世代最强的经典三冠赛事第一战，『皋月赏』。\n前哨战中强势取胜的东海帝王，吸引了众人的目光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "826a797267084458dc7756ab7fe4b674191e648efc4f9db858aa34b8ec141d03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
