    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b619cd688c818b704086a521",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她毫不隐藏想被认可的贪婪，为此用尽一切手段。\n那份投注在自我包装上的执念——",
      "source_fingerprint": "40421150a32cf675e00161fdfd53f2a8900e96327818926b1c793cf138d45f1f",
